  "unknowns_or_conflicts": [
    {
      "description": "Main breaker one-line prints 400N while general elevation prints MDS-400; preserve original IDs and explicit main functional role. ATS also contains a 400N contact, so a bare tag is not a globally unique identity."
    },
    {
      "description": "No feeder frame inferred from ampere trip values where AF is absent."
    },
    {
      "description": "Elevation notes call this a general layout and require final physical configuration per approved shop drawings; no such manufacturer output supplied."
    },
    {
      "description": "Space locations in general elevation do not imply populated spare breakers; the one-line has a distinct 100A 407 spare breaker."
    },
    {
      "description": "The bus label says65kA symmetrical, not a literal breaker interrupting-current requirement. Scored as bus_symmetrical_short_circuit_ka; do not coerce it into device interrupting capacity or a certified assembly SCCR."
